"<p>Nitrobase periodically checks upstream registries for newer template releases and Git branch commits.</p>\n<h2>Safe Update Pipeline</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Pre-Update Backup:</strong> Takes an automatic snapshot of the app's persistent volumes.</li>\n<li><strong>Deploy New Version:</strong> Pulls the new image and updates configuration.</li>\n<li><strong>Health Check Verification:</strong> Waits for the container to become healthy.</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Rollback:</strong> If the health check fails, the previous container version and backup are restored automatically.</li>\n</ol>"